      "description": "Optional (absent with --null-trials 0). Per-beam report times shuffled within the same species and UTC hour, events re-clustered, pass = event with a window of >= 2 beams; null_* are over `trials` seeded draws; excess = real_pass_rate - null_pass_rate. Report-only: no tier or decision reads it.",
